        "original_id": "87b9cf97-72ac-5272-a208-c89bb5e0c06a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Andrew Stanton, John Lasseter\n- Companies: Pixar, Disney\n- Products: A Bug's Life, Finding Nemo, WALL-E, John Carter\n- Topics: film writing, film directing\n\nFacts:\n- In 1998, Andrew Stanton co-directed Pixar's film \"A Bug's Life.\"\n- In 1998, John Lasseter directed \"A Bug's Life.\"\n- \"A Bug's Life\" follows a misfit ant named Flik, who seeks tough warriors to protect his colony from greedy grasshoppers but instead recruits an inept circus troupe.\n- In 2003, Andrew Stanton wrote and directed Pixar's film \"Finding Nemo.\"\n- In 2008, Andrew Stanton wrote and directed Pixar's film \"WALL-E.\"\n- In 2012, Andrew Stanton wrote and directed Disney's live-action film \"John Carter.\"",
